    "trial_id": "NCT04687215",
    "brief_title": "Diabetic Neuropathy in Spinal Cord Stimulator Patients",
    "official_title": "Spinal Cord Stimulation Improves Pain, Arterial Stiffness and Vascular Flow in Lower Extremities in Patients With Diabetes Mellitus Type II A Multidisciplinary Collaborative Prospective Study",
